      <li><a style="color:var(--accent)" href="https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/article/the-fed-was-unanimous-about-raising-rates-in-september-economic-signals-have-since-changed-184839972.html" target="_blank">Yahoo Finance, 7 Oct 2026</a> &mdash; September payrolls, unemployment, core PCE, Fed officials' tone</li>
      <li><a style="color:var(--accent)" href="https://www.roic.ai/news/traders-no-longer-fully-price-in-fed-rate-hike-before-end-2026-10-22-2026" target="_blank">ROIC News, 22 Oct 2026</a> &mdash; September minutes, ECB hike, analyst views</li>
