      <li><a style="color:var(--accent)" href="https://www.cmegroup.com/education/files/trading-sofr-options-whitepaper.pdf" target="_blank">CME Group</a> &mdash; SOFR options expiry rule; <a style="color:var(--accent)" href="https://fedratecalc.com/fomc-meeting-schedule/" target="_blank">FedRateCalc</a> &mdash; FOMC dates</li>
